    "long_instructions": "## User Testing\r\n\r\nYour flight planner is ready for takeoff, but what do your passengers think? Swap seats with a classmate to test out each other's apps.\r\n\r\n\r\n1. **Observe the Flow:** Click through your partner's app to experience all three outcomes.\r\n\r\n2. **Consider Human-Centered Reliability:** Do the three states have a similar personality and vibe? Do the messages and icons make sense? Do you know which state is which?\r\n\r\n3. **Share Your Feedback:** Give your partner feedback on their app. Make sure to share your thoughts on loading, empty, and error states."
